{"id":"en_if-love-had-stayed","title":"If Love Had Stayed","titleEn":"If Love Had Stayed","description":"Helen Gray saw Benjamin Green as the one bright spot in her life, until the truth came out: he had only drawn close to her to make his ex, Janet Gray, jealous. Wounded by the deception, Helen turns her back on that cruel game and instead weds Bobby Hall, an heir who lies in a coma. Yet the past will not remain quiet, as love, treachery, and hidden truths keep surfacing, leaving her tale unfinished. Those who wish to follow the series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/if-love-had-stayed/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/if-love-had-stayed/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Cinderella","Compulsory love","Deception","High Society","Underdog Rise"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl6pe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_if-love-had-stayed_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl6pe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_if-love-had-stayed_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl6pe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_if-love-had-stayed_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl6pe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_if-love-had-stayed_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl6pe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_if-love-had-stayed_5","title":"Episode 5